    "instructions": "The state is one dataLayer push as JSON. Rule: it is a GA4 purchase event only if `event` equals \"purchase\" and `ecommerce` contains transaction_id, value, currency (a 3-letter ISO 4217 code), and an items array with at least one item that has item_id or item_name. Does this push satisfy every part of the rule?"
  },
